{
    "title": "MySubaru",
    "description": "The MySubaru app seamlessly connects you to your Subaru. Enjoy remote start, unlock/lock, service scheduler, digital history, vehicle locator, and 24/7 roadside assistance. \r\n\r\nWhether it's starting your vehicle and controlling the car's temperature remotely, scheduling a service appointment, or monitoring authorized drivers, the MySubaru app puts the power of your Subaru at your fingertips. With MySubaru, you can connect to convenience and safety.\r\n\r\nRemote Features:\r\n\r\n\u25aaRemote Start*\r\n\r\n\u25aaRemote Lock, Unlock, and Vehicle Locator***\r\n\r\n\u25aaRemote Climate Control settings from your smartphone***\r\n\r\n\u25aaRemote Horn and Lights\r\n\r\nService Features:\r\n\r\n\u25aaSchedule Service Appointments**\r\n\r\n\u25aaTrack Your Vehicle\u2019s Service History\r\n\r\n\u25aa Get Vehicle Maintenance Reminders and recall notices\r\n\r\n\u25aaReal-time Vehicle Health Notifications***\r\n\r\n\u25aaAccess Owner\u2019s Manuals and How-To Videos\r\n\r\n\u25aaVehicle Diagnostics*****\r\n\r\n\u25aaUsage Report***\r\n\r\n\u25aaFind Nearby Subaru Retailers and Certified Collision Centers\r\n\r\n\r\nSafety and Security Features:\r\n\r\n\u25aa24-Hour Roadside Assistance****\r\n\r\n\u25aaAutomatic Collision Notifications***\r\n\r\n\u25aaAccess Starlink Safety and Security features***\r\n\r\nConvenience Features:\r\n\r\n\u25aaExclusive special offers and coupons\r\n\r\n\u25aaManage the drivers in your household with Boundary, Speed, and Curfew Alerts*****\r\n\r\n\u25aaPlan and save trips, then send directions to your Starlink navigation system***\r\n\r\n\u25aa Trip Logs******\r\n\r\n\u25aaDriving Journals******\r\n\r\n\u25aaTouch and Face ID for Remote Services\r\n\r\n\u25aaValet Mode Status******\r\n\r\n\u25aa Valet Passcode Reset******\r\n\r\n\u25aa Contact Subaru Customer Support\r\n\r\n\r\n*Remote Engine Start is available on keyless access with push button start vehicles. Remote Engine Start with Climate Control is available on vehicles with keyless access with push button start and automatic climate control. Not available on vehicles with manual transmission.\r\n\r\n**Service Scheduler function is not available for all Subaru retailers.\r\n\r\n***Subaru owners must have an active Starlink subscription to access remote services.\r\n\r\n****24-hour roadside is included in standard 3-year warranty and after 3 years with a gold package.\r\n\r\n*****Available on select 2019 and newer models.\r\n\r\n******These features are available only for Model Year 2023 and newer Subaru vehicles.\r\n\r\n\u00a9 2024 Subaru of America, Inc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The MySubaru app seamlessly connects you to your Subaru. Enjoy remote start, unlock/lock, service scheduler, digital history, vehicle locator, and 24/7 roadside assistance. <br><br>Whether it&#39;s starting your vehicle and controlling the car&#39;s temperature remotely, scheduling a service appointment, or monitoring authorized drivers, the MySubaru app puts the power of your Subaru at your fingertips. With MySubaru, you can connect to convenience and safety.<br><br>Remote Features:<br><br>\u25aaRemote Start*<br><br>\u25aaRemote Lock, Unlock, and Vehicle Locator***<br><br>\u25aaRemote Climate Control settings from your smartphone***<br><br>\u25aaRemote Horn and Lights<br><br>Service Features:<br><br>\u25aaSchedule Service Appointments**<br><br>\u25aaTrack Your Vehicle\u2019s Service History<br><br>\u25aa Get Vehicle Maintenance Reminders and recall notices<br><br>\u25aaReal-time Vehicle Health Notifications***<br><br>\u25aaAccess Owner\u2019s Manuals and How-To Videos<br><br>\u25aaVehicle Diagnostics*****<br><br>\u25aaUsage Report***<br><br>\u25aaFind Nearby Subaru Retailers and Certified Collision Centers<br><br><br>Safety and Security Features:<br><br>\u25aa24-Hour Roadside Assistance****<br><br>\u25aaAutomatic Collision Notifications***<br><br>\u25aaAccess Starlink Safety and Security features***<br><br>Convenience Features:<br><br>\u25aaExclusive special offers and coupons<br><br>\u25aaManage the drivers in your household with Boundary, Speed, and Curfew Alerts*****<br><br>\u25aaPlan and save trips, then send directions to your Starlink navigation system***<br><br>\u25aa Trip Logs******<br><br>\u25aaDriving Journals******<br><br>\u25aaTouch and Face ID for Remote Services<br><br>\u25aaValet Mode Status******<br><br>\u25aa Valet Passcode Reset******<br><br>\u25aa Contact Subaru Customer Support<br><br><br>*Remote Engine Start is available on keyless access with push button start vehicles. Remote Engine Start with Climate Control is available on vehicles with keyless access with push button start and automatic climate control. Not available on vehicles with manual transmission.<br><br>**Service Scheduler function is not available for all Subaru retailers.<br><br>***Subaru owners must have an active Starlink subscription to access remote services.<br><br>****24-hour roadside is included in standard 3-year warranty and after 3 years with a gold package.<br><br>*****Available on select 2019 and newer models.<br><br>******These features are available only for Model Year 2023 and newer Subaru vehicles.<br><br>\u00a9 2024 Subaru of America, Inc.",
